8. Design pattern:
    The design patterns selected for this project are : command and strategy
    Command is pretty straightforward:
    Strategy:
        The strategy pattern has three things:
            1. The context -> Class that utilizes the strategies (The main class that can switch between the strategy at runtime)
            2. Strategy Interface -> A common class which will initialise, store and help the context call the concrete strategies
            3. Concrete strategies -> The concrete strategies are the strategies implemented and which can be called by the strategy interface.

